<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls to 7.89 pct on 3-mo Italian BOT.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls to 7.89 pct on 3-mo Italian BOT.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 16.75 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     7.89	(8.44)    98.07	  (97.94)</p>
<p>    6-month     8.16	(8.53)    96.15	  (95.92)</p>
<p>    1-year	8.19	(8.54)    92.45	  (92.15)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on August 27.</p>
</text>
